Z||000003||Nashco||11-24-2001||10:31 PM||||Yes, lots of people have turboed the 2.8.  A lot of people have also upgraded to different engines before doing a turbo.  Basically...name an engine style and it's been done.  Seriously, I dare you to name anything gas powered, four stroke, and between 2 and 7 liters, I'm willing to bet it's been done!  Turbos, superchargers, nitrous, v8s, aluminum motors, updated automatic transmissions...it's all been done.<P>What kind of Fiero do you want, a notchback or fastback?  Also..FYI, the 84-87 and the 88 have different suspensions.  Like was suggested, use the search function to find out about engine swaps or ask a specific question...and welcome to the forum!<P>Oh, by the way...I love the GSXs!  Must be nice...<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT<BR>*edited typo*<p>[This message has been edited by Nashco (edited 11-24-2001).]||||reg||1
